      "name": "Season 8",
      "overview": "Voight and the team pursue a ruthless crime ring whose business has hit close to home. As they dig deeper, the extent of the danger becomes more apparent. Deputy Superintendent Samantha Miller second-guesses her decisions. Voight and the team muster all their expertise to bring down a deadly crime ring.",
